00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:37.480
don't be afraid to let them know that

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:39.000
you don't know something.

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:42.440
And that is how we grow. And don't feel

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:45.440
